# 第七部分：Job、Revision、Version 版本系统

## 7.1 关系模型

```text
SourceProduct（只读）
  └─ SourceManifest 001
       ├─ RemakeJob 001
       │    ├─ StrategySet（最多3个候选）
       │    ├─ Revision 001（策略A，AI初稿）
       │    ├─ Revision 002（策略A，人工修改）
       │    │    └─ ProductVersion 001（批准）
       │    └─ Revision 003（策略B，另一分支）
       │         └─ ProductVersion 002（若以后批准）
       └─ RemakeJob 002（另一次重制目标）

SourceManifest 002（原始归档变化）
  └─ 新 Job；旧结果保留，但标记来源已更新
```

关系规则：一个 SourceProduct 可有多个 Manifest；一个 Manifest 可有多个 Job；一个 Job 可有多个 Revision 和最多三个策略候选；一个 Revision 只绑定一个选定策略；只有 APPROVED Revision 可晋升 Version；发布模块未来只能消费 Version。

## 7.2 Job 数据结构

```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "job_id": "job_20260915_001",
  "source_product_id": "source_product_001",
  "source_manifest_sha256": "64位哈希",
  "intent": "FULL_REMAKE",
  "status": "HUMAN_REVIEW",
  "current_revision_id": "revision_003",
  "strategy_set_revision_id": "revision_001",
  "created_at": "2026-09-15T03:00:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-09-15T03:10:00Z",
  "created_by": "local_user",
  "idempotency_key": "source_product_001:哈希:FULL_REMAKE",
  "events": [
    { "event_id": "event_001", "type": "JOB_CREATED", "at": "2026-09-15T03:00:00Z", "revision_id": "revision_001" }
  ]
}
```

job.json 允许更新当前状态，但 events 只能追加；节点输出仍保存在不可变 Revision。

## 7.3 Revision 数据结构

```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "revision_id": "revision_003",
  "job_id": "job_20260915_001",
  "revision_number": 3,
  "parent_revision_id": "revision_002",
  "branch_reason": "HUMAN_REQUESTED_CONTENT_REVISION",
  "selected_strategy_id": "strategy_001",
  "source_manifest_sha256": "64位哈希",
  "status": "NEEDS_REVIEW",
  "started_from_node": "CONTENT_GENERATION",
  "artifacts": {
    "product_dna": "../../shared/product-dna.revision_001.json",
    "strategy_set": "../../shared/strategy-set.revision_001.json",
    "content_draft": "content-draft.json",
    "image_plan": "image-plan.json",
    "validation_report": "validation-report.json"
  },
  "change_summary": ["根据人工意见调整标题方向"],
  "created_at": "2026-09-15T03:08:00Z",
  "created_by": "AI_WORKFLOW"
}
```

Revision 目录写完并生成 manifest 后封存；任何修改都新建下一 Revision；编号单调递增；复用上游产物要引用不可变文件及哈希。

## 7.4 Version 数据结构

```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "version_id": "version_001",
  "version_number": 1,
  "source_product_id": "source_product_001",
  "source_manifest_sha256": "64位哈希",
  "job_id": "job_20260915_001",
  "approved_revision_id": "revision_003",
  "selected_strategy_id": "strategy_001",
  "status": "READY_FOR_EXPORT",
  "title": "人工批准的新标题",
  "description": "人工批准的新描述",
  "selling_points": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "cover_copy": {},
