# 第八部分：Evidence 证据链设计

## 8.1 设计目标

证据链不是给整篇文案挂一个“来源”，而是把可验证的**事实声明 Claim**逐条关联到一个或多个 Evidence。情绪性表达和策略性定位可以不建立事实证据，但不得伪装成商品事实。

## 8.2 Claim 数据结构

```json
{
  "claim_id": "claim_101",
  "claim": "资料包包含5000条提示词",
  "claim_type": "QUANTITY",
  "claim_scope": "CONTENT_DRAFT",
  "artifact_ref": "content-draft.json#/selling_points/0",
  "status": "SUPPORTED",
  "evidence_ids": ["evidence_201"],
  "requires_human_confirmation": false,
  "created_by_node": "CONTENT_GENERATOR",
  "created_at": "2026-09-15T10:00:00+08:00"
}
```

`claim_type` 建议枚举：`IDENTITY`、`QUANTITY`、`SPECIFICATION`、`BRAND_MODEL`、`CONDITION`、`DELIVERY`、`AUTHORIZATION`、`TIMELINESS`、`PERFORMANCE`、`BENEFIT`、`AUDIENCE_FIT`、`OTHER`。

`status`：

- `SUPPORTED`：至少一条有效支持证据；
- `PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED`：只有间接证据或证据不足以覆盖完整表述；
- `UNSUPPORTED`：没有支持证据；
- `CONTRADICTED`：存在直接冲突；
- `HUMAN_CONFIRMED`：由人工明确确认，并保留确认记录。

## 8.3 Evidence JSON Schema

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://local.xianyu-ai/schemas/evidence.schema.json",
  "title": "EvidenceSet",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["schema_version", "source_product_id", "claims", "evidence", "generated_at"],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": { "type": "string", "const": "1.0.0" },
    "source_product_id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
    "claims": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["claim_id", "claim", "claim_type", "claim_scope", "artifact_ref", "status", "evidence_ids", "requires_human_confirmation"],
        "properties": {
          "claim_id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "claim": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "claim_type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["IDENTITY", "QUANTITY", "SPECIFICATION", "BRAND_MODEL", "CONDITION", "DELIVERY", "AUTHORIZATION", "TIMELINESS", "PERFORMANCE", "BENEFIT", "AUDIENCE_FIT", "OTHER"] },
          "claim_scope": { "type": "string", "enum": ["PRODUCT_DNA", "STRATEGY", "CONTENT_DRAFT", "IMAGE_PLAN", "HUMAN_EDIT"] },
          "artifact_ref": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["SUPPORTED", "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "UNSUPPORTED", "CONTRADICTED", "HUMAN_CONFIRMED"] },
          "evidence_ids": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" }, "uniqueItems": true },
          "requires_human_confirmation": { "type": "boolean" }
        }
      }
    },
    "evidence": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
